    - target: {fileID: 6668015293666917239, guid: d7425ed2047e64d8ea6ff79f20bd46f6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: HelpText
      value: "This scene shows Confiner2D confining the camera inside a box collider,
        such that it does not see outside the map.\n\nTo toggle between projection
        modes, you can use the Orthographic Camera toggle in the top left corner
        of the Game View.  \n\nNote: When the camera's projection mode changes, Confiner2D's
        lens cache is invalidated to force an adjustment of the confiner to fit the
        new camera projection mode.\n\nThe Camera Magnets illustrate a dynamic modification
        of the Target Group.  Toggling them on makes them attract the camera's attention:
        the closer the player is to the magnet, the stronger the attraction.  This
        is implemented by the MagnetGroupController behaviour on the CameraMagnets
        object."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9138370430051789472, guid: d7425ed2047e64d8ea6ff79f20bd46f6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: HelpUI
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
